OL,3,GNEWSAHear ye, hear ye: Meet the        
OL,4,Abewigged bricklayers, teachers and     
OL,5,Aamateur actors going 18th Century      
OL,7,FThe event, which will give an estimated
OL,8,F40,000 visitors a flavour of what made 
OL,9,Fthe old city tick over the weekend,    
OL,10,Fsees a host of local characters take   
OL,11,Fcentre stage, including Marcellus      
OL,12,Fwho'll be roaming the streets telling  
OL,13,Fthe great unwashed what's what.        
